    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "StateFlow has been evaluated on several benchmarks, including InterCode SQL and ALFWorld. The results show that StateFlow <strong>significantly outperforms</strong> existing methods, including ReAct and Plan & Solve, in terms of success rate and efficiency. StateFlow also <strong>reduces the cost</strong> of LLM inference by up to 5x.",
